[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……真面目ですわね、あなたは。\n出会った時から変わらず",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You have always been so earnest. From the very day we met."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はは……\n社長殿にはたびたびご迷惑をおかけいたしました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hah... I have caused you no end of trouble along the way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うう……今月も苦しい……\nまたバイト増やさないと……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... another tight month... I'm going to need more shifts..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（っ！\u3000事務所から……もしや仕事の依頼！？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Wait—a call from the agency... could it be a job offer?!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！\u3000……はい。はい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! ...Yes. Yes..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え……クビ……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What... you're letting me go...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ……この先どうすれば……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What am I supposed to do now..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこのあなた。少しいいかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Excuse me. Might I have a word?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、はい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わたくし、こういう者です。\nあなたを我が社にスカウトしに来ましたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Allow me to introduce myself. I am here to scout you for my agency."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララ・プロダクション……って、あの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara Productions... you mean THE—!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鬼門さん。あなたが長らくアイドルとして芽が出ず、\n燻っていることは存じております",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon. I am aware that you have been struggling for some time without gaining any real footing as an idol."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うう……そんなはっきり言わなくても",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You didn't have to say it quite so plainly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しかし、それを知っているならなにゆえ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But if you know that, then why would you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたにはアイドルの才能があります",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Because you have genuine talent as an idol."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "芽が出ないのは、事務所の売り出し方に\n原因がある、とわたくしは分析しておりますわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The problem, in my analysis, lies not with you, but with how your previous agency chose to present you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたがまだ夢を諦めていないのなら、\nわたくしについておいでなさいな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you have not yet given up on your dream, then come with me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなた宛てのファンレター、\nそちらの箱にしまってありますわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your fan mail is in that box over there, by the way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお！\u3000って、やはり今回も１通だけですか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! ...Just the one letter again, though..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その送り主、以前も名前を見た記憶がありますわ。\n熱心なファンなのですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I recognize that sender's name. They have written before. A devoted fan."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、まあ。前の事務所にいた頃から、\nよく手紙をいただいておりまして",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes... they have been writing to me since my days at the old agency."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その熱意に報いるためにも、\n頑張らねばなりませぬ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I must keep working hard, if only to honor their dedication...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その真面目さはあなたの長所ですわね。\nただ、アイドルとしては少々固すぎるかもしれません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That dedication is one of your greatest strengths. Though for an idol, you may be just a touch too serious."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う、それは拙者も自覚しておりますが……\n昔からの性分なものでして……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I know. It has simply always been my nature..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "むむむ……これも家の教えが古臭いせいでござる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bah... this is what comes of being raised on such old-fashioned principles!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふむ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それでは、ユニットを組んでみましょうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What if I put you in a unit?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Pardon?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その真面目さはリーダー向きですわ。多少個性の強い\nメンバーでも、あなたならまとめられるはず",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your earnestness makes you a natural leader. Even with strong personalities in the mix, I believe you could hold the group together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しゃ、社長殿！？\u3000そんないきなり！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ma'am—right now, just like that?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうと決まれば、早速メンバー探しといきましょう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then it's settled. Let's get started finding your members!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お、お待ちくだされー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "P-please, wait—!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それからトントン拍子に話は進み、\nついには大きな舞台まで……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And from there, things moved faster than I ever expected. Until at last we stood on a stage like that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このひと月……拙者にとっては\n夢のような時間でございまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "These past weeks... have felt like a dream."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……寂しいですが、あなたの決めたことならば、\nわたくしは尊重いたしますわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...It is difficult to accept. But if this is the path you have chosen, I will respect it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "年末のカウントダウンフェス……\n必ず成功させ、盛大に花道を飾りましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Countdown Festival at year's end... we will make it a success. A send-off worthy of everything you have given."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……はい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]